ancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p028","text":"蔡澤者，燕人也。游學干諸侯小大甚眾，不遇。而從唐舉相，曰：「吾聞先生相李兌，曰『百日之內持國秉』，有之乎？」曰：「有之。」曰：「若臣者何如？」唐舉孰視而笑曰：「先生曷鼻，巨肩，魋顏，蹙齃，膝攣。吾聞聖人不相，殆先生乎？」蔡澤知唐舉戲之，乃曰：「富貴吾所自有，吾所不知者壽也，願聞之。」唐舉曰：「先生之壽，從今以往者四十三歲。」蔡澤笑謝而去，謂其御者曰：「吾持粱刺齒肥，躍馬疾驅，懷黃金之印，結紫綬於要，揖讓人主之前，食肉富貴，四十三年足矣。」去之趙，見逐。之韓、魏，遇奪釜鬲於涂。聞應侯任鄭安平、王稽皆負重罪於秦，應侯內慚，蔡澤乃西入秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蔡澤","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"李兌","kind":"person","person_id":"eqx_c6q_58a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"聖人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-07